  // ✒ Key Features:
  //     - Fixed port 5500, matching the README's Python server command
  //     - Full Edge executable path, version-proof across Live Server
  //       releases
  //     - Personal overrides belong in *.local.json, which .gitignore skips
  //
  // ✒ Other Important Information:
  //     - Dependencies: VS Code with the Live Server extension; Microsoft Edge
